{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"# Cristal Oscuro\n💎 Secret key item of each chapter, obtained by defeating the corresponding secret boss. Five confirmed to date (Ch.1-5)."},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/ShadowCrystals.png","x":-75,"y":-425,"width":190,"height":110},{"id":"s0","type":"text","x":-150,"y":-925,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Seam**\nThe only character who receives and studies the Shadow Crystals as they're obtained; his comments are the main source of information about their nature."},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Seam_Face.webp","x":-95,"y":-1315,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":332,"y":-768,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Jevil**\nFirst confirmed bearer (Ch.1). After meeting Strange Someone, he believes the world is just a game."},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jevil.gif","x":628,"y":-1080,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":630,"y":-358,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Spamton**\nSecond confirmed bearer (Ch.2), in his corrupted NEO form."},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton.gif","x":1075,"y":-465,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":630,"y":148,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nThird bearer (Ch.3), the only one whose battle isn't hidden as a secret boss."},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":1075,"y":295,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s4","type":"text","x":332,"y":558,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Gerson Boom**\nFourth bearer (Ch.4), as Hammer of Justice. Seam feels \"hope\" for the first time."},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Hammer_of_Justice_battle_idle.gif","x":628,"y":910,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s5","type":"text","x":-150,"y":715,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Pink**\nFifth and final confirmed bearer (Ch.5), the most hidden one. Her battle reveals that the Crystals are \"failed dreams\"."},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Mad_Mew_Mew_Pink.gif","x":-95,"y":1145,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s6","type":"text","x":-632,"y":558,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"**Shadow Mantle (ERAM)**\nSibling item, not a Crystal: reduces Dark/Star damage. Given by ERAM, the \"Shadow Mantle Holder\", same thematic circle."},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/shadow_mantle.gif","x":-818,"y":910,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s7","type":"text","x":-930,"y":148,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**🎲 Who is \"Strange Someone\"?**\nContacted at least Jevil and Spamton before their decline. Identity unconfirmed — speculated to possibly be linked to the Voice/Gaster."},{"id":"s8","type":"text","x":-930,"y":-358,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**🎲 The \"Pure Crystal\"**\nUnused item in the files, described as \"the shadow purified by the cat\" — a possible nod to Seam. Cut content, never implemented."},{"id":"s9","type":"text","x":-632,"y":-768,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**🎲 The fallen star and the crystal**\nA book from the 2nd Sanctuary describes tears from a fallen star that formed something \"crystal-like\" — a possible symbolic origin, without direct confirmation."},{"id":"s8-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/ShadowCrystals.png","x":-1208,"y":-445,"width":190,"height":170},{"id":"s9-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/shadow_crystal_lagrimas_cristal_teoria.webp","x":-787,"y":-1028,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e_center-img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s0","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s1","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s4","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s5","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6-img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s6","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s7","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s8","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s8","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s9","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s9","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s8-img","fromNode":"s8-img","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s8","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s9-img","fromNode":"s9-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_seam_purecrystal","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s8","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_jevil_extrano","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_spamton_extrano","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_seam_estrella","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s9","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_seam_mantle","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s6","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_seam_gerson","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_pink_estrella","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s9","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"}]}